hadiths[57]{hadithnumber,text}:
"758","Hamein Bishr bin Muhammad ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abdullah ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: hamein Ibrahim bin Nashit ne hadith bayan ki, Kaab bin Alqama se, Abu al-Haitham se, unhon ne kaha: kuch log Hazrat Uqba bin Amir ke paas aaye to unhon ne kaha: hamare kuch hamsaye sharab peete hain aur aise kaam karte hain, to kya hum unhen imam ke paas pesh karen, unhon ne kaha: nahin, main ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: jo kisi Musalman ki koi aeb wali baat dekhe phir use chhupaye, woh us shakhs ki tarah hai jis ne zinda dafn ki hui bachchi ko us ki qabr se zinda kar liya."
"759","Hamein Ismail ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Malik ne hadith bayan ki, Suhail bin Abi Salih se, un ke walid se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: jab tum kisi aadmi ko ye kehte hue suno ke log halaak ho gaye, to wahi un mein sab se zyada halaak hone wala hai."
"760","Hamein Ali bin Abdullah ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Muaz bin Hisham ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe mere walid ne hadith bayan ki, Qatada se, Abdullah bin Buraida se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: munafiq ko sayyid na kaho, pas agar woh tumhara sayyid hua to tum ne apne Rabb Azza wa Jalla ko naraaz kar diya."
"761","Hamein Makhlad bin Malik ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Hajjaj bin Muhammad ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Mubarak bin Fadala ne khabar di, Bakr bin Abdullah al-Muzani se, Adi bin Artat se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sahaba mein se jab kisi aadmi ka tazkiya bayan kiya jata to woh kehta: Ae Allah mujhe un baton par pakar na farma jo ye kehte hain, aur meri un khataon ko bakhsh de jinhen ye nahin jante."
"762","Hamein Abu Asim ne hadith bayan ki, Auzaai se, Yahya bin Abi Kathir se, Abu Qilaba se ke Abu Abdullah ne Abu Masud se kaha, ya Abu Masud ne Abu Abdullah se kaha: tum ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se zaama ke baare mein kya suna hai, unhon ne kaha: aadmi ki sawari kitni buri hai."
"763","Hamein Yahya bin Musa ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Umar bin Yunus al-Yamami ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Yahya bin Abdul Aziz ne hadith bayan ki, Yahya bin Abi Kathir se, Abu Qilaba se, Abul Muhallab se ke Abdullah bin Amir ne kaha: Ae Abu Masud, tum ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko zaamu ke baare mein kya farmate hue suna hai, unhon ne kaha: main ne Aap ko farmate hue suna: aadmi ki sawari kitni buri hai, aur main ne Aap ko farmate hue suna: momin par lanat karna use qatl karne ke barabar hai."
"764","Hamein Ali bin Abdullah ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Amr ne kaha: Hazrat Ibn Abbas se ke tum mein se koi kisi aisi cheez ke baare mein jise woh nahin janta ye na kahe: Allah ise janta hai, jabke Allah us ke khilaf janta ho, pas woh Allah ko woh bataye jo Allah nahin janta, to ye Allah ke nazdeek bahut bada gunaah hai."
"765","Hamein Hasan bin Umar ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abdul Waris ne hadith bayan ki, Ali bin Zaid se, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Yusuf bin Mihran ne hadith bayan ki, Hazrat Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Majjarra aasman ke darwazon mein se ek darwaza hai, aur rahi qaus e quzah to woh Hazrat Nuh alaihis salam ki qaum ke baad gharq hone se aman hai."
"766","Hamein al-Humaidi ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne hadith bayan ki, Ibn Abi Husain aur un ke ilawa dusron se, Abu at-Tufail se ke Ibn al-Kawwa ne Hazrat Ali se Majjarra ke baare mein poocha, unhon ne kaha: woh aasman ka jod hai, aur usi se aasman musladhar pani se khola gaya."
"767","Hamein Arim ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abu Awana ne hadith bayan ki, Abu Bishr se, Said bin Jubair se, Hazrat Ibn Abbas se ke qaus zameen walon ke liye gharq se aman hai, aur Majjarra aasman ka woh darwaza hai jo us se phatta hai."
"768","Hamein Musa bin Ismail ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Abul Haris al-Kirmani ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: main ne ek aadmi ko Abu Raja se kehte hue suna: tum par salam padhta hun, aur Allah se sawal karta hun ke mujhe aur tumhen Apni rehmat ke thikane mein jama kare, unhon ne kaha: kya koi is ki taqat rakhta hai, unhon ne kaha: phir Us ki rehmat ka thikana kya hai, unhon ne kaha: Jannat hai, unhon ne kaha: tum ne durust baat na kahi, unhon ne kaha: phir Us ki rehmat ka thikana kya hai, unhon ne kaha: main ne kaha: Rabbul Alamin hai."
"769","Hamein Ismail ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Malik ne hadith bayan ki, Abu az-Zinad se, Aaraj se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: tum mein se koi ye na kahe: hae zamane ki naakaami, pas beshak Allah hi zamana hai."
"770","Muhammad bin Ubaidullah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hatim bin Ismail ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu Bakr bin Yahya Ansari se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat kiya ke Aap ne farmaya: tum me se koi ye na kahe: hae zamane ki namuradi, Allah Azza wa Jalla farmata hai: Main hi zamana hun, Main raat aur din ko bhejta hun, phir jab chahun un dono ko rok leta hun, aur angoor ko hargiz karm na kaho, pas beshak karm Musalman aadmi hai."
"771","Bishr bin Muhammad ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne ham ko khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne Lais se, unhon ne Mujahid se, unhon ne kaha: makruh hai ke aadmi apne bhai ki taraf nazar jama kar dekhe, ya jab wo peeth pher kar jaye to apni nigah us ke peeche lagaye, ya us se pooche: tum kahan se aaye ho aur kahan ja rahe ho."
"772","Musa ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne Qatada se, unhon ne Hazrat Anas se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ek aadmi ko dekha jo qurbani ke oont ko hank raha tha, to Aap ne farmaya: is par sawar ho ja, to us ne kaha: ye qurbani ka oont hai, Aap ne farmaya: is par sawar ho ja, us ne kaha: ye qurbani ka oont hai, Aap ne farmaya: is par sawar ho ja, us ne kaha: pas beshak ye qurbani ka oont hai, Aap ne farmaya: is par sawar ho ja, tera bura ho."
"773","Ibrahim bin al Munzir ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Alqama Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Abi Farwa ne ham se bayan kiya, mujh se Miswar bin Rifaa Qurazi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Hazrat Ibn Abbas ko suna jabke ek aadmi un se sawal kar raha tha, to us ne kaha: main ne roti aur gosht khaya hai, to kya main wuzu karun, to unhon ne kaha: tera bura ho, kya tu pakeeza cheezon se wuzu karta hai."
"774","Ali ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Abu Zubair ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Hazrat Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Hunain ke din Jirana me the aur sona Hazrat Bilal ki god me tha aur Aap taqseem farma rahe the, to Aap ke pas ek aadmi aaya to us ne kaha: insaf kijiye, pas beshak aap insaf nahin karte, to Aap ne farmaya: tera bura ho, phir kaun insaf karega jab main insaf na karun, Hazrat Umar ne kaha: mujhe ijazat dijiye Ya Rasoolullah ke main is munafiq ki gardan maar dun, to Aap ne farmaya: beshak ye apne kuch sathiyon ke sath hai, ya unhon ne kaha: apne kuch sathiyon me hai, jo Quran parhte hain jo un ki hansliyon se aage nahin guzarta, wo deen se is tarah nikal jayenge jis tarah teer shikar se paar ho jata hai."
"775","Sahl bin Bakkar ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aswad bin Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne Khalid bin Sumair se, unhon ne Bashir bin Nuhayk se, unhon ne Bashir se, aur un ka naam Zahm bin Mabad tha, pas unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki taraf hijrat ki, to Aap ne farmaya: tumhara naam kya hai, unhon ne kaha: Zahm, Aap ne farmaya: balke tum Bashir ho, unhon ne kaha: ek dafa main Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sath chal raha tha jab Aap mushrikon ki qabron ke pas se guzre to Aap ne farmaya: tahqeeq in logon se pehle bohat bhalai guzar chuki teen martaba, phir Aap Musalmanon ki qabron ke pas se guzre to Aap ne farmaya: tahqeeq in logon ne bohat bhalai pa li hai teen martaba, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki taraf se ek nazar pari, to Aap ne ek aadmi ko dekha jo qabron me chal raha tha aur us par do joote the, to Aap ne farmaya: ae do sibti jootiyan wale, apni dono sibti jootiyan utar de, to us aadmi ne dekha, phir jab us ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko dekha to us ne apne dono joote utar kar unhen phenk diya."
"776","Ibrahim bin al Munzir ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Abi Fudaik ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne Muhammad bin Hilal se ke unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki biwiyon ke hujre dekhe jo khajoor ki tehniyon se bane hue the aur baalon ke tat se dhaanpe hue the, to main ne un se Hazrat Ayesha ke ghar ke bare me poocha, to unhon ne kaha: us ka darwaza Sham ki taraf tha, to main ne kaha: kya wo ek pat ka tha ya do pat ka, unhon ne kaha: wo ek hi darwaza tha, main ne kaha: wo kis cheez se bana hua tha, unhon ne kaha: arar ya sagwan ki lakdi se."
"777","Ibrahim bin al Munzir ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Fudaik ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abi Yahya se, unhon ne Saeed bin Abi Hind se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: qayamat qaim nahin hogi yahan tak ke log aise ghar banayenge jinhen wo marahil ki naqsh o nigar ki tarah naqshdar banayenge, Ibrahim ne kaha: is se murad khatdar kapde hain."
"778","Muhammad bin Salam ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Fuzail bin Ghazwan ne ham ko khabar di, unhon ne Umara se, unhon ne Abu Zura se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se ke ek aadmi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pas aaya to us ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah, kaun sa sadqa sawab me sab se afzal hai, Aap ne farmaya: suno, tumhare baap ki qasam tumhen zaroor is ki khabar di jayegi ke tum sadqa karo jabke tum tandurust ho, bakheel ho, faqr se darte ho aur maldari ki ummeed rakhte ho, aur dheel na karo yahan tak ke jab jan halaq tak pahunch jaye to kaho: fulan ke liye itna aur fulan ke liye itna, halanke wo pehle hi fulan ka ho chuka tha."
"779","Abu Nuaim ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Amash ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne Abul Ahwas se, unhon ne Hazrat Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: jab tum me se koi hajat talab kare to use narmi se talab kare, pas beshak use wahi milega jo us ke liye muqaddar kiya gaya hai, aur tum me se koi apne sathi ke pas aa kar us ki tareef na kare ke us ki kamar tod de."
"780","Musaddad ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ayyub se, unhon ne Abul Malih bin Usama se, unhon ne Abu Azza Yasar bin Abdullah Huzali se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat kiya, Aap ne farmaya: beshak Allah jab kisi bande ki rooh kisi zameen me qabz karna chahta hai to us ke liye wahan, ya unhon ne kaha: us me, koi hajat paida kar deta hai."
"781","Musa ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Saq ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Abu Jamra ko suna, unhon ne kaha: mujh ko Abu Abdul Aziz ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Abu Huraira hamare pas raat ko thehre, to unhon ne apne samne ek sitare ko dekha to unhon ne kaha: qasam us Zaat ki jis ke hath me Abu Huraira ki jan hai, zaroor wo log jo duniya me hukoomaton aur kamon par rahe ye chahenge ke kash wo us sitare ke pas latke hue hote aur un hukoomaton aur un kamon ko na sambhalte, phir wo meri taraf mutawajjeh hue to unhon ne kaha: tumhare dushman ko rahat na mile, kya ye sab mashriq walon ke liye un ke mashriq me raas aaya, main ne kaha: han Allah ki qasam, unhon ne kaha: tahqeeq Allah ne bura kiya aur tadbeer ki, pas qasam us Zaat ki jis ke hath me Abu Huraira ki jan hai, zaroor wo unhen surkh ghazabnak gadon ki tarah hankayenge, goya un ke chehre moti tavon wali dhalen hain, yahan tak ke wo kheti wale ko us ki kheti se aur doodh wale janwar wale ko us ke doodh se mila denge."
"782","Matar bin Fadl ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hajjaj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Juraij ne kaha: main ne Mughis se suna, woh bayan karte the ke Hazrat Ibn Umar ne un se poocha: tumhara maula kaun hai, to unhon ne kaha: Allah aur falan shakhs, to Hazrat Ibn Umar ne kaha: is tarah mat kaho, Allah ke sath kisi ko shareek mat thehrao, lekin yun kaho: Allah ke baad falan shakhs."
"783","Abu Nuaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne Ajlah se, unhon ne Yazid se, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Abbas se bayan kiya: ek shakhs ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se kaha: jo Allah chahe aur aap chahen, Aap ne farmaya: tum ne Allah ke liye shareek bana diya, kaho jo Allah akela chahe."
"784","Abdullah bin Saleh ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Aziz bin Abi Salama ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdullah bin Dinar se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar ke sath bazaar ki taraf nikla, to woh ek chhoti bachchi ke paas se guzre jo gaana gaa rahi thi, to unhon ne farmaya: beshak shaitan agar kisi ko chhorta to is bachchi ko chhor deta."
"785","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya bin Muhammad Abu Amr Basri ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: main ne Amr maula Muttalib se suna, unhon ne kaha: main ne Hazrat Anas bin Malik ko kehte hue suna: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: main khel tamashe se nahin hun aur na khel tamasha mujh se kisi cheez me hai, yani batil ka mujh se koi talluq nahin hai."
"786","Hafs bin Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khalid bin Abdullah ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ata bin Saib ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne Saeed bin Jubair se, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Abbas se bayan kiya ke Allah ke farman aur logon me se koi aisa hai jo behuda baton ko kharidta hai ke bare me unhon ne farmaya: is se murad gaana aur is jaisi cheezen hain."
"787","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Fazari aur Abu Muawiya ne hamen khabar di, un donon ne kaha: Qinan bin Abdullah Nahmi ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Ausaja se, unhon ne Hazrat Bara bin Azib se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: salam ko aam karo salamati paoge, aur itarana shar hai."
"788","Isam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Haraiz ne Salman bin Sumair Alahani se, unhon ne Hazrat Fazala bin Ubaid se bayan kiya, aur woh logon ke ek ijtima me the, to unhen khabar pahunchi ke kuch log koba se khel rahe hain, to woh ghusse ki halat me khare hue aur us se nihayat sakhti se mana kiya, phir farmaya: khabardar raho, beshak is se khelne wala is ka phal khata hai jaise khinzeer ka gosht khane wala aur khoon se wuzu karne wala khata hai, koba se murad chauser hai."
"789","Abdullah bin Abi Aswad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Wahid bin Ziyad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Haris bin Hasira ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zaid bin Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Hazrat Ibn Masood ko kehte hue suna: beshak tum aise zamane me ho jis me us ke faqih bahut hain, us ke khateeb thore hain, us me mangne wale thore hain, dene wale bahut hain, is me amal khwahish ko chalne wala hai, aur tumhare baad tum par zaroor aisa zamana aayega jis me us ke faqih thore honge, us ke khateeb bahut honge, us me mangne wale bahut honge, dene wale thore honge, is me khwahish amal ko chalne wali hogi, jaan lo ke akhri zamane me achchha chalan baaz amal se behtar hai."
"790","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khalid bin Abdullah ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne Jurairi se, unhon ne Abu Tufail se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne un se kaha: kya aap ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko dekha hai, unhon ne kaha: ji han, aur main zameen ki pusht par kisi zinda shakhs ko nahin janta jis ne mere siwa Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko dekha ho, unhon ne kaha: aur Aap gore rang wale khubsurat chehre wale the."
"791","Farwa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaida bin Humaid ne Qabus se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se bayan kiya, Aap ne farmaya: achchha chalan aur achchha waza qata aur miyana rawi nabuwwat ke pachees hisson me se ek hissa hai."
"792","Muhammad bin Sabah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Walid bin Abi Saur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Simak se, unhon ne Ikrima se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha se poocha: kya aap ne kabhi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko sher parhte hue suna hai, to unhon ne farmaya: kabhi kabhi jab Aap apne ghar me dakhil hote to yeh kehte: aur tumhen khabren woh dega jise tum ne tosha nahin diya."
"793","Abu Nuaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne Lais se, unhon ne Taus se, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Abbas se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: beshak yeh Nabi ka kalima hai: aur tumhen khabren woh dega jise tum ne tosha nahin diya."
"794","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awana ne hum se bayan kiya, Umar bin Abi Salama se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi tamanna kare to use dekhna chahiye ke woh kya tamanna kar raha hai, kyunke woh nahi janta ke use kya diya jayega."
"795","Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, Simaak se, Alqama bin Wail se, un se un ke walid ne ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Tum me se koi hargiz al-karm na kahe aur al-habala kaho yani angoor."
"796","Ahmad bin Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, apne chacha Musa bin Yasar se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka guzar ek shakhs par hua jo ek badana haank raha tha to Aap ne farmaya: Is par sawar ho ja, to us ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah, ye to badana hai, to Aap ne farmaya: Is par sawar ho ja, us ne kaha: Ye to badana hai, Aap ne teesri ya chauthi martaba me farmaya: Tera bura ho, is par sawar ho ja."
"797","Abdur Rahman bin Sharik ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Aqeel se, Ibrahim bin Muhammad se, Imran bin Talha se, unhon ne apni walida Hamna bint Jahsh se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Ye kya hai, ae hantah."
"798","Qutaiba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, Aamash se, Habib bin Suhban Asadi se ke unhon ne Ammar ko dekha ke unhon ne farz namaz parhi phir apne pehlu wale ek shakhs se kaha: Ae hanah, phir khare ho gaye."
"799","Ali bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim bin Maisara se, Amr bin Sharid se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mujhe apne peeche sawar kiya to Aap ne farmaya: Kya tumhare paas Umayya bin Abi Salt ke sher me se kuch hai, maine kaha: Ji haan, to maine Aap ko ek sher sunaya to Aap ne farmaya: Heeh, yahan tak ke maine Aap ko sau sher sunaye."
"800","Muhammad bin Bashshar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawood ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid bin Khumair se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abdullah bin Abi Musa ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Ayesha ne kaha: Qiyam-ul-lail na chhoro, kyunke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam use tark nahi karte the aur jab Aap beemar hote ya sust hote to baith kar namaz parhte the."
"801","Khalid bin Makhlad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Bilal ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Amr bin Abi Amr ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Anas bin Malik ko kehte hue suna: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam kasrat se ye dua karte the: Ae Allah, main Teri panah mangta hun fikr aur gham se, aajizi aur susti se, buzdili aur bakhl se, qarz ke bojh se aur logon ke ghalbe se."
"802","Ali bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Judan se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Anas bin Malik ko kehte hue suna: Abu Talha Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke samne ghutnon ke bal baithe the aur apne tarqash ke teer bikher rahe the aur keh rahe the: Mera chehra Aap ke chehre ke liye dhaal hai aur meri jaan Aap ki jaan par qurban hai."
"803","Muadh bin Faddala ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham se, Hammad se, Zaid bin Wahb se, Abu Dharr se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam Baqi ki taraf nikle aur main Aap ke peeche peeche chala, to Aap ne mur kar mujhe dekha to farmaya: Ae Abu Dharr, to maine kaha: Hazir hun Ya Rasoolullah aur khidmat ke liye tayyar hun aur main Aap par qurban hun, to Aap ne farmaya: Beshak zyada maal wale Qayamat ke din kam sawab wale honge siwae us ke jo is tarah aur is tarah haq me kharch kare, maine kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasool zyada jante hain, to Aap ne teen martaba is tarah farmaya, phir hamare samne Uhud aaya to Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abu Dharr, to maine kaha: Hazir hun Ya Rasoolullah aur khidmat ke liye tayyar hun aur main Aap par qurban hun, Aap ne farmaya: Mujhe ye pasand nahi ke Uhud Aal-e-Muhammad ke liye sona ho phir un ke paas ek dinar ya Aap ne farmaya: ek misqal bhar subah tak bacha rahe, phir hamare samne ek wadi aayi to Aap utar kar ek taraf hue to maine samjha ke Aap ko hajat hai, to main kinare par baith gaya aur Aap mujh se door der tak rahe, unhon ne kaha: To mujhe Aap par khauf hua, phir maine Aap ko suna goya Aap kisi shakhs se sargoshi kar rahe hain, phir Aap mere paas akele bahar aaye, to maine kaha: Ya Rasoolullah, woh kaun shakhs tha jis se Aap sargoshi kar rahe the, to Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne use suna tha, maine kaha: Ji haan, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak woh Jibril the jo mere paas aaye, to unhon ne mujhe khushkhabri di ke jo meri ummat me se is haal me mara ke woh Allah ke sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karta tha woh Jannat me dakhil hoga, maine kaha: Agarche us ne zina kiya ho aur chori ki ho, Aap ne farmaya: Ji haan."
"804","Qabisa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Saad bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Abdullah bin Shaddad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Hazrat Ali raziyallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: Maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko Saad ke baad kisi shakhs ke liye fidya ke alfaaz kehte nahi dekha, maine Aap ko farmate hue suna: Teer chala, mere maan baap tujh par qurban hon."
"805","Ali bin al-Hasan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Husain ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Buraida ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam masjid ki taraf nikle aur Abu Musa qirat kar rahe the, to Aap ne farmaya: Ye kaun hai, to maine kaha: Main Buraida hun, Aap par qurban jaun, Aap ne farmaya: Ise Aal-e-Dawood ke mizmaron me se ek mizmar ata kiya gaya hai."
"806","Bishr bin al Hakam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mahboob bin Muhriz al Kufi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Saab bin Hakeem ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se, unhon ne kaha: Main Hazrat Umar bin al Khattab raziyallahu anhu ke paas aaya to woh kehne lage: Ae mere bhai ke bete, phir unhon ne mujh se sawal kiya to maine un ko apna nasab bataya to unhon ne pehchan liya ke mere walid ne Islam ka zamana nahi paya to woh kehne lage: Ae mere bete ae mere bete."
"807","Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jareer bin Hazim ne humein khabar di, Salm al Alawi se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Anas ko kehte hue suna: Main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka khadim tha, unhon ne kaha: To main baghair ijazat liye andar chala jata tha, phir ek din main aaya to Aap ne farmaya: Ae mere bete wahin thehre raho, kyunke tumhare baad ek naya hukum hua hai: Tum ijazat ke baghair andar hargiz dakhil na hona."
"808","Abdullah bin Saleh ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Aziz bin Abi Salama ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Sasa se, unhon ne apne walid se, ke Abu Saeed al Khudri ne un se kaha: Ae mere bete."
"809","Muhammad bin Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Hazrat Ayesha raziyallahu anha se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Tum me se koi hargiz ye na kahe: Meri jaan khabees ho gayi, lekin ye kahe: Meri jaan sust ho gayi."
"810","Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Laith ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab se, Abu Umama se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Tum me se koi hargiz ye na kahe: Meri jaan khabees ho gayi, aur use ye kehna chahiye: Meri jaan sust ho gayi."
"811","Ahmad bin Yaqub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazeed bin al Miqdam bin Shuraih bin Hani al Harisi ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid al Miqdam se, unhon ne Shuraih bin Hani se, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Hani bin Yazeed ne bayan kiya ke jab woh apni qaum ke sath Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas wafad ban kar aaye to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un ko suna ke woh un ki kunniyat Abu al Hakam rakhte hain to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne unhein bulaya phir farmaya: Beshak Allah hi al Hakam hai aur faisla usi ki taraf hai to tum ne apni kunniyat Abu al Hakam kyun rakhi, unhon ne kaha: Nahi lekin meri qaum jab kisi cheez me ikhtilaf karti hai to mere paas aati hai to main un ke darmiyan faisla karta hun to dono fareeq raazi ho jate hain, Aap ne farmaya: Ye kitni achhi baat hai, phir farmaya: Tumhari aulad me kaun kaun hain, maine arz kiya: Mere Shuraih aur Abdullah aur Muslim Hani ke bete hain, Aap ne farmaya: To un me sab se bada kaun hai, maine arz kiya: Shuraih, Aap ne farmaya: To tum Abu Shuraih ho, aur Aap ne un ke liye aur un ki aulad ke liye dua farmayi."
"812","Muhammad bin al Musanna ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salm bin Qutaiba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Haml bin Basheer bin Abi Hadrad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se mere chacha ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu Hadrad se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Kaun hamare in oonton ko hankega ya farmaya: Kaun hamare in oonton ko pahunchayega, ek shakhs ne kaha: Main, to Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara naam kya hai, us ne kaha: Fulan, Aap ne farmaya: Baith jao, phir doosra khada hua to Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara naam kya hai, us ne kaha: Fulan, to Aap ne farmaya: Baith jao, phir teesra khada hua to Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara naam kya hai, us ne kaha: Najiya, Aap ne farmaya: Tum is kaam ke liye ho pas inhein hanko."
"813","Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jareer ne humein khabar di, Qaboos se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabiullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam tezi se hamari taraf aaye aur hum baithe hue the yahan tak ke un ki hamari taraf tez aamad ne humein ghabra diya, phir jab woh hamare paas pahunche to salam kiya phir farmaya: Main tumhari taraf tezi se is liye aaya hun taake tumhein Shab e Qadr ki khabar dun phir mere aur tumhare darmiyan use bhool gaya pas use aakhri ashray me talash karo."
"814","Muhammad bin Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ahmad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham bin Saeed ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Muhajir ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Aqeel bin Shabeeb ne bayan kiya, Abu Wahb se, aur unhein sohbat hasil thi, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Ambiya ke naamon par naam rakho, aur Allah azza wa jalla ko sab se zyada mehboob naam Abdullah aur Abdur Rahman hain, aur sab se sachche naam Haris aur Hammam hain, aur sab se bure naam Harb aur Murrah hain."
